              "line": 3,
              "heading": "ZX Bank – Branch Network in Bhutan"
            },
            "text": "ZX Bank Ltd. has established a robust and accessible banking infrastructure across Bhutan, supporting both urban and semi-urban communities. The branch network ensures that customers in key regions — Thimphu, Paro, Punakha, Phuentsholing, and Gelephu — have convenient access to retail banking, digital services, and remittance facilities. Below, find region-wise details of branch locations, IFSC codes, and contact numbers to assist customers in connecting with our local banking offices."
          }
